# Analyze Documentation Rule

## Description
This rule analyzes the content of the docs directory before generating code to ensure that the generated code aligns with the existing documentation.

## Actions
### Analyze Directory
- type: analyze_directory
- path: .cursor/docs
- recursive: true
- include_patterns: 
  - **/*.md
- priority: high

## Metadata
- purpose: Ensure that generated code aligns with existing documentation
